1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:08,882
The wall is 171" and the run is 168". Fix it in Elevation.

2
00:00:08,882 --> 00:00:16,703
Keep it symmetric: widen the two drawer bases at the ends by 1-1/2" each.

3
00:00:16,703 --> 00:00:24,343
B5 gets the same 19-1/2".

4
00:00:24,343 --> 00:00:39,268
And the wall cabinets over them, W1 and W5, so the uppers still line up.

5
00:00:39,268 --> 00:00:44,683
They now overlap their neighbours. Arrange along the back wall closes the run up again.

6
00:00:44,683 --> 00:00:51,185
19-1/2 + 24 + 36 + 24 + 19-1/2 + 24 + 24 = 171": wall to wall, no gap.

7
00:00:51,185 --> 00:01:06,808
In 3D the kitchen now fills the wall from corner to corner.

8
00:01:06,808 --> 00:01:09,810
Next: a walk around the finished kitchen and its cut list.
